{"batch_number":35,"batch_size":96,"cases":[{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-01-sentence-003","input":"鉴于 2020 年人口普查面临新冠病毒 COVID-19 疫情传播带来的特殊挑战，人口普查局计划发布更多数据质量指标。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-quality-assessments/2020-census-quality-assessments-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-01-sentence-003","split":"press_release_01"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-01-sentence-010","input":"这些指标是对人口普查局已经为 2020 年人口普查提供的早期指标的补充，包括细化到普查区域水平的自己回答率(仅英语)、州 (state) 一级的初始完成率(仅英语)、地区人口普查办公室 (Area Census Office) 的 NRFU 工作量完成率(仅英语)、和国家管理记录与代理人受访者(仅英语)普查率。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-quality-assessments/2020-census-quality-assessments-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-01-sentence-010","split":"press_release_01"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-01-sentence-029","input":"这些估算是使用当前和原有的出生与死亡记录、国际人口迁移数据和医疗记录创建的。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-quality-assessments/2020-census-quality-assessments-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-01-sentence-029","split":"press_release_01"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-01-sentence-030","input":"它们完全独立于 2020 年人口普查人数。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-quality-assessments/2020-census-quality-assessments-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-01-sentence-030","split":"press_release_01"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-02-sentence-002","input":"美国宪法强制规定每十年开展一次人口普查。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/census-day/census-day-chinese-simiplified.html","source_case_id":"page-02-sentence-002","split":"press_release_02"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-02-sentence-015","input":"在大学生上学的地址算上大学生。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/census-day/census-day-chinese-simiplified.html","source_case_id":"page-02-sentence-015","split":"press_release_02"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-02-sentence-018","input":"要了解关于“算上谁”问题的更多答案，请访问 2020 Census。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/census-day/census-day-chinese-simiplified.html","source_case_id":"page-02-sentence-018","split":"press_release_02"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-02-sentence-021","input":"现在就回答，最大限度地减少人口普查员在今年晚些时候拜访您的住宅对您跟进访谈。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/census-day/census-day-chinese-simiplified.html","source_case_id":"page-02-sentence-021","split":"press_release_02"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-02-sentence-023","input":"所有尚未在线回答的住户都将在 4 月 8 日到 16 日之间收到一份纸质问卷。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/census-day/census-day-chinese-simiplified.html","source_case_id":"page-02-sentence-023","split":"press_release_02"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-03-sentence-009","input":"将于 6 月底将宣布这 6 个地区人口普查办公室 (area census offices)。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-additional-operations/ensure-accurate-census-count-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-009","split":"press_release_03"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-03-sentence-012","input":"将为所有人口普查员进行社交疏离规则培训。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-additional-operations/ensure-accurate-census-count-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-012","split":"press_release_03"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-03-sentence-015","input":"重新访谈是为了确认每一个人口普查员都接受了我们的培训，并正确地完成了他们的工作。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-additional-operations/ensure-accurate-census-count-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-015","split":"press_release_03"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-03-sentence-016","input":"重新访谈将由不同的人口普查人员进行，而不是最初访问该住户的人。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-additional-operations/ensure-accurate-census-count-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-016","split":"press_release_03"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-04-sentence-001","input":"2020 年 3 月 9 日 — 2020 年人口普查的邀请本周开始陆续送达住户的邮政信箱，美国人口普查局希望您知道一个事实，即您现在可以用比以往任何时候都更多的语言来回答。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/languages/languages-chinese-simiplified.html","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-001","split":"press_release_04"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-04-sentence-007","input":"不太可能在线回答的住户也将在首次邀请中收到纸质问卷。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/languages/languages-chinese-simiplified.html","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-007","split":"press_release_04"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-04-sentence-010","input":"从 5 月中旬开始，全国各地的人口普查员将走访那些没有回答的住户，亲自收集答案。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/languages/languages-chinese-simiplified.html","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-010","split":"press_release_04"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-05-sentence-005","input":"人口普查员将按计划从八月开始拜访尚未回答 2020 年人口普查的住户。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-60-percent/60-percent-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-05-sentence-005","split":"press_release_05"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-05-sentence-006","input":"从 5 月 4 日那周开始，人口普查局与联邦、州 (state)和地方卫生官员协调，在选定地理区域分阶段地重新恢复部分2020 年人口普查的外勤操作。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-60-percent/60-percent-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-05-sentence-006","split":"press_release_05"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-05-sentence-010","input":"所有复工的工作人员都将得到关于社交疏离规则的安全培训，并在重新开始工作前收到个人防护装备。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-60-percent/60-percent-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-05-sentence-010","split":"press_release_05"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-006","input":"人口普查局将在 6 月 14 日继续更新/普查操作。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-006","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-012","input":"人口普查局将逐渐开始软启动未回复随访。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-012","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-022","input":"截止 6 月 11 日，78% 的 Alaska 偏远地区工作已经完成。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-022","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-038","input":"此外，人口普查局扩大了媒体供应商列表，通过在数字、印刷、电视和无线电广播平台上的付费广告扩大了人口普查局对历来被低估的人口的影响。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-038","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-07-sentence-001","input":"2020 年 6 月24日 — 美国人口普查局今日宣布人口普查局将向尚未回答 2020 年人口普查的住户发送额外提醒明信片。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/additional-2020-reminder/additional-2020-reminder-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-07-sentence-001","split":"press_release_07"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-07-sentence-007","input":"明信片 – 计划于 6 月底发送 – 警示住户人口普查员将上门递送人口普查邀请或者会与他们进行访谈。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/additional-2020-reminder/additional-2020-reminder-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-07-sentence-007","split":"press_release_07"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-07-sentence-009","input":"新冠病毒 (COVID-19) 疫情大流行推迟了向一些社区发送普查邀请的时间，但人口普查员已重新开始分阶段在全国各地投递邀请函。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/additional-2020-reminder/additional-2020-reminder-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-07-sentence-009","split":"press_release_07"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-07-sentence-010","input":"我们鼓励住户在收到邀请邮包后尽快回答 2020 年的人口普查。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/additional-2020-reminder/additional-2020-reminder-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-07-sentence-010","split":"press_release_07"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-08-sentence-001","input":"2020 年 12 月 15 日 — 美国人口普查局今天发布了 2020 年人口分析报告，该报告提供了截至 2020 年 4 月 1 日国家人口的一系列的低、中和高估计值。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-demographic-analysis-estimates/2020-demographic-analysis-estimates-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-08-sentence-001","split":"press_release_08"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-0